WEBVTT

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.700
We're done down here.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:18.960
Claire, give it a go!

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.200
Okay.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.300
Seems like it's all right.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.110
What's wrong, Ari?

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:44.850
Nothing...

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:50.350
<i>It's been four months since Isla 
left the Balsteros Republic.</i>

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:07.650
Okay!

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.420
<i>We're starting to look a bit like real pilots.</i>

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:13.180
<i>At least, I hope so.</i>

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:15.220
Morons!

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:20.760
Your rotors are wide open, greenhorns!

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.870
Chiharu, drop altitude.

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:28.590
We're failing at recon.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:30.150
Roger.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:35.190
<i>Everyone's expressions are</i>

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.610
<i>quite different than they used to be.</i>

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:43.990
<i>It's summer.</i>

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:49.870
<i>And we've nearly reached 
the legendary Holy Spring.</i>

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:26.720
<b>Episode 5 
The Girl Who Calls the Wind</b>

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.020
Everyone, line up at attention.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:32.900
Hurry!

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:40.030
You'll never be real pilots like that.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:41.900
Question, sir...

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.260
Why are we training like this?

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.620
We're pilot trainees...

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.780
Ground combat is a part of pilot training.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.930
You won't always be fighting in the air.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:54.770
But...

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.440
Is that the only question?

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.960
Then we'll begin water training.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.300
And me...

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:11.480
Well? Is it beautiful?

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:16.150
Muscles!

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:19.450
Charge!

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:21.060
Everyone, keep up!

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:24.750
If any of you drops out, you'll all be 
punished with a hundred push-ups!

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.270
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.750
Give me a break...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.420
Those two are monsters...

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.070
Training's over.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.060
You are dismissed for today.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.220
Thank you.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:46.740
As we approach the Spring, 
the knights are standing by.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:49.770
Once in a while, you guys should 
also get a chance to relax!

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.680
Anyone who wants to stay and 
have fun is welcome to do so.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.430
If you're hungry, catch a fish and eat it!

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:00.040
Anyone who doesn't want to go 
home, practice making camp.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.380
Got it?

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.830
We can make a camp here!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:13.290
Thank you, Mr. Bandereas!

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:17.160
Ari, are you a monster?

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:19.040
Her endurance is amazing.

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:22.210
I'm gonna do it...

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.460
I'm gonna have fun

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.220
with a girl in a swimsuit.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.720
Right, come on, Noripii!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.560
Yeah, this might be fun.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.490
Lately, we've been training all the time.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:36.750
Then it's settled...

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.660
We'll all camp here.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.000
Let's go, Mitty.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.110
Y-Yeah.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.090
What do you want to do, Benji?

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:49.990
I'm the type of person who follows the crowd.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.340
What about you, Wolf?

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:51.990
Yes.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:05:59.090
Let's go, Claire!

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.270
But my curfew...

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:02.610
It's fine.

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:04.010
There's still time.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:05.880
Claire!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.060
See? Ari's calling for you.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:10.900
Yeah.

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:15.470
This is stupid. We're leaving.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.030
Tickle, tickle, tickle!

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.060
Tickle, tickle, tickle!

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:29.790
Ari!

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:32.490
That tickles!

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:40.810
Having fun, Mitty?

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:41.420
Yes.

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:43.500
Tickle, tickle, tickle, tick—

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.510
Ari!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.420
I knew I'd find you over there!

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:55.710
What?

00:06:55.710 --> 00:07:00.440
You're always off to the side, 
secretly watching us.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:05.610
If you want to join in the fun,
 just say so, Igna.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.620
Hey, come on.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:11.620
Wait, I...

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.070
Come on!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.850
Is there any spicier bread?

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:22.460
No...

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.460
I'll get this, too!

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:36.270
Don't see that often.

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:39.830
I guess you can't turn 
down a girl, either...

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.300
You're ignoring me?

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.860
I think he might have 
the right to ignore you.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:49.190
Noripii's so silly, no one 
does anything he says.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.190
He's got the depth of a puddle.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:52.540
What?

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:54.660
No one's as deep as I am!

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.230
Benji's a bookworm.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:56.950
A bookworm?

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.470
Mitsuo's an otaku.

00:07:58.470 --> 00:07:59.120
Otaku?

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.330
Wolf's a muscle gorilla.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.590
A muscle gorilla!

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:03.420
That isn't a compliment.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:07.460
And Kal's a dork, so I'm the 
closest one to a leader.

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:09.420
Then what's Igna?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.050
A tsundere?

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.130
You're ignoring me again?!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.120
Not much of a leader...

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:19.250
He's more of an extra than a leader.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.890
He just doesn't stand out.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.070
Shut up!

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.810
Don't treat me like an extra!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:24.690
Right, right.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.020
See you later, irrelevant guy.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.690
H-Hey, don't call me that!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:37.510
What was Ari thinking, 
bringing Ignacio over?

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:40.580
Kal-el, can I ask you something?

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.290
Go ahead.

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:46.540
I have the feeling we've 
been going in circles...

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:52.420
I thought you knew the way.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.730
And I thought you...

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.170
L-Let's get back to everyone...

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.560
Or we'll get stranded again!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.890
Ow...

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:15.500
S-Sorry, Claire... Are you okay?

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.700
Fine, and you?

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:25.000
No, I didn't mean to...

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:38.550
Claire...

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:45.700
Dork.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:48.920
RA?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.790
Oh, I'm sorry. Don't mind me.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:53.050
I do mind you!

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:54.360
When did you get here? Why?!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:58.850
Every day, I walk around 
the lake in the evening.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:00.780
How was I supposed to know that?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.780
Come on, let's go.

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:07.790
Don't worry. I won't tell anyone.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:12.030
What's her problem?

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:13.250
Jeez...

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.380
Claire?

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.540
Listen, let me walk you home.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.440
I'm fine.

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:33.080
I'll see you at school tomorrow.

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:36.760
Y-Yeah, see you tomorrow.

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.030
You leaving, too?

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:48.000
I'm not here, on Isla, to pretend 
to be people's friend.

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:51.960
Are you, Kal-el Albus?

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:12.850
Thank you, Michael.

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:14.730
I will definitely return.

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:19.620
I'll find the End of the Sky, 
and become a great pilot.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:25.240
I was telling the truth, but...

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:28.250
I understand...

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:32.390
So the new government figured 
it out a long time ago.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:39.030
Only a very small number are aware 
of Karl la Hire's survival.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.920
But if it's discovered...

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:44.700
I'll end up a political tool?

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.060
Do what you want, but count me out.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.250
We have a suggestion.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:55.020
We'd like you to participate in the Isla Project.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:57.400
Me? Why?

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:04.110
Nina Viento will also be on Isla, as governor.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.740
We thought you might be
 interested in an opportunity

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:11.910
to live on the same island with her.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:13.690
What the hell is wrong with you?!

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.430
He's in the new government's way,

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:17.750
so you're sending him to the End of the Sky?

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:21.420
You're just exiling him to get rid of him!

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.420
Dad...

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.520
Tell me more.

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.800
Nina Viento...

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:34.100
What do I want to do here?

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.230
On Isla?

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:46.730
The <i>Luna Barco</i> has charged 
its hydrogen battery stack.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.670
It will return to Isla in fifty minutes.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:53.080
We're nearly at the Holy Spring.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:58.150
I suppose we've reached the first major obstacle.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:00.840
Even if you're right, so what?

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.630
Our home country has abandoned us.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:07.640
Even if we finish our journey, 
we've nowhere to return.

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:12.560
<i>Yes, I am a doll that is no longer needed.</i>

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:14.670
<i>Nina Viento.</i>

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:18.850
<i>Ever since that day, nine years ago.</i>

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.990
<i>I grew up in a village on the outskirts</i>

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:27.630
<i>of Balsteros.</i>

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:31.330
<i>For as long as I could remember,</i>

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:34.580
<i>I'd had a strange power.</i>

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:38.040
<i>But because of that power...</i>

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.160
Get out!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.640
Witch! Witch!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:43.300
Get out of the village!

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:45.480
No, please...

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:48.340
I can't give my daughter 
to the moneylenders.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.470
Then you want your whole 
family to die homeless?

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.550
Get out, witch!

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:16.460
The wind's blowing up from the ground?

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.630
Wind-calling?

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.020
Did you know

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:49.450
that Saint Aldista was born from the wind?

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:51.780
Yes...

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:56.780
Originally, Saint Aldista was a wind god.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.750
"Witch" is just slander.

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:02.380
You are blessed by a god.

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.830
Please lend us your power.

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:09.130
We need you...

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:14.260
You need me?

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:29.110
<i>The Empire was already a single 
step from destruction.</i>

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:32.170
<i>The people sought salvation.</i>

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:38.540
<i>But...</i>

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:41.330
<i>That day, six years ago...</i>

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:42.620
Nina...

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.420
Nina Viento!

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:53.150
<i>...I realized what a sinner I am.</i>

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.940
Excuse me.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:05.810
This is...

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.480
Hello!

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.520
I am Isla's admiral.

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:13.480
Next year, I'll be traveling
 to the End of the Sky.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.910
My name is Luis de Alarcon.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:21.960
Would you like to come and fly with me?

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:36.550
I wanted to show you this.

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:39.990
What is your name?

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:43.810
Claire Cruz...

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:45.190
Claire...

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.630
A good name.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.760
Who gave it to you?

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.240
My mother.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:57.320
She was a very weak person, 
but I loved her.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.670
Do you like the sky, Claire?

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.190
Yes.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:05.270
Then I'd like to make a request of you.

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:08.590
I want you to come to Isla.

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:12.660
You've lost the power to call the wind,

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:15.590
so I hate to ask another difficult task of you.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:19.900
But even still, we need you.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.420
Claire.

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:37.270
Claire...

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:39.940
I'm sorry.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:46.390
<i>If Kal-el really is Karl la Hire...</i>

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:48.750
<i>Then I...</i>

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.650
We'll be using paintballs.

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:53.760
A one-on-one mock battle?

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:59.680
A fair dogfight, just like 
classic Balsteros chivalry!

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.140
You're getting too excited, Mitty.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:07.290
Claire, um... About earlier...

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.030
I'm sorry for what happened at the camp!

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.450
If you're mad at me...

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:17.780
No, I'm not.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.920
It was my fault...

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.710
Have you seen the match lineup?

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.080
It looks like—

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.620
Get lost, Fausto.

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:32.130
Right now, I'm talking to Claire.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:37.300
Seriously, why don't you guys split up?

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.990
Begin combat!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.910
Kal-el! Claire!

00:18:58.910 --> 00:18:59.950
You can do it!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:04.200
Am I imagining things, or are they 
moving more unevenly than usual?

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:08.540
Drop our speed, 
and get them in front of us.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:10.950
Claire!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.010
Claire...

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.110
I'm sorry, I...

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:34.060
Claire, I want to stay your partner.

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.870
I don't know what will happen in the future.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:42.460
But right now, I want to fly 
these skies with you.

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:45.910
Is that all right?

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.590
Same here.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:00.550
I want to fly with you, Kal-el...

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.960
If I could, I'd stay like this forever.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.810
I want to stay who I am...

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.190
You are who you are.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:19.890
Let's go.

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:20.990
Right!

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:24.120
H-Hey, look at them.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:25.370
They're back to normal!

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:31.080
They're doing well.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:36.080
Yes, they work better together 
than almost anyone else.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:40.060
What's wrong, Ari?

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.810
Oh, it's nothing!

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:45.130
You can do it, guys!

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:49.470
Now, Kal-el!

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:54.140
We did it!

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.370
Emergency landing.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.410
Hurry!

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:11.100
This is not a drill!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.000
The Sky Clan?

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.380
The Guardians of the Holy Spring

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:25.490
from the Myth of Saint Aldista?

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.390
I had no idea they really existed...

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.430
How stupid.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:31.980
They're mere barbarians time has left behind.

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:33.190
Shoot them down.

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:34.640
Every single one!

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.270
Yes, sir.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:40.530
Kal-el, I'm taking us down!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:41.690
G-Got it!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.700
What's going on?

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:32.470
It's me, Ignacio.

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:36.050
Lately, his sister's been calling 
me "Igna" for some reason.

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:37.180
It's irritating.

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:39.480
But she is a good cook.

